{"id":"632909","name":"凉拌苦菊","author":"守护jia","authorId":"10251966","desc":"","cover":"images/632909/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦菊","amount":"1颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"麻辣花生","amount":"少许"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苦菊洗净。","img":"images/632909/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱切丝用冰水泡一下大概泡个20分钟。","img":"images/632909/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜切丝。","img":"images/632909/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"食材一起放在大碗中。","img":"images/632909/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小米椒，蒜泥放在碗中。","img":"images/632909/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中烧热放油，直到油冒烟，倒入祘泥碗中，爆出香味。","img":"images/632909/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入花生，蒜泥用手抓拌均匀。","img":"images/632909/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"抓拌均匀装盘。","img":"images/632909/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}